Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, adduser, python3-dbus, python3-gi, bluez, avahi-daemon, systemd, udev, kmod, usb-modeswitch, usb-modeswitch-data, iproute2, nftables, device-tree-compiler, mount, wpasupplicant, rfkill
Description: Network, USB Ethernet and tablet relay for Apple Vision Pro
 Receives Wacom tablet input through Linux input devices and provides
 tablet enrollment and authenticated readings over TCP and Bluetooth LE.
 Advertises the active network service automatically through Avahi.
 Provides authorized Wi-Fi client management and wired USB Ethernet controls.
 Includes a managed system service and persistent headset trust. This setup
 component and the raw-HID workstation drawing service are installed together.
 Drawing runs as an unprivileged service with its own persistent identity.
